- dispatch.rs: PerTransportDispatchQueue (§66) + doc coverage for
  §63/§64/§65 (already real via siar-protocol-ext's FairScheduler/
  BoundedQueue, not reimplemented)
- fairness.rs (new): generic RoundRobinFairQueue<K,T> covering both
  §67 (per-peer) and §68 (per-extension) fairness
- descriptor.rs: derive Hash on ContentClass so it can key
  RoundRobinFairQueue
- lib.rs: mod fairness; + updated doc-comment coverage map

71/71 tests (up from 63), clippy clean, fmt clean, doc-warning-free.
Zero regressions in siar-dtn-bundle/siar-identity-multidevice/
siar-protocol-ext.
